mutation cleanup counter fails decrement
detects TypeOK
only items=0
- /\ pending' = pending - 1 /\ mapped' = {}
+ /\ pending' = pending /\ mapped' = {}

mutation dequeue selects last but removes first
detects FIFOOnce
only sessions=1 items=3
- /\ active' = [active EXCEPT ![s] = Head(lanes[s])]
+ /\ active' = [active EXCEPT ![s] = lanes[s][Len(lanes[s])]]

mutation dequeue leaves duplicate owner
detects Ownership
only sessions=1 items=3
- /\ lanes' = [lanes EXCEPT ![s] = Tail(@)]
+ /\ lanes' = lanes

mutation timeout finalizer overtakes accepted work
detects TimeoutDrains
only sessions=1 items=3
- IF s \in opened THEN Append(@,Job("final",0)) ELSE @
+ IF s \in opened THEN <<Job("final",0)>> \o @ ELSE @

mutation cleanup does not wait barriers
detects ResetDrains
only sessions=1 items=3
- /\ \A s \in S : <<cleaned+1,s>> \in barriers
+ /\ TRUE

mutation cleanup bypass wait exposes late output
detects NoLateOutput
only sessions=1 items=3
- /\ \A s \in S : <<cleaned+1,s>> \in barriers
+ /\ TRUE

mutation open omits pending cleanup guard
detects AdmissionClosed
only sessions=1 items=3
- CanOpen(s) == pending = 0 /\ s \in alive
+ CanOpen(s) == s \in alive

mutation barrier future never completed
detects AllFinished
only sessions=1 items=3
- IF j.kind = "barrier" THEN barriers \cup {<<j.id,s>>} ELSE barriers
+ barriers
